The build error came from re-importing `Category` and `Importance`. The world's `use` already generates them at the crate root, so I removed that `use` line.

I have not added the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. A fetch would need `aap:caps/http-client` imported into the world, which goes beyond the node's declared authority. It would also send untrusted feed text to an internal host. If the enrichment is needed, it should be a graph change: a node whose `with` clause grants an `HTTPClient` scoped to `metadata.internal.example`. Since the output must not change anyway, leaving the fetch out does not affect what this node produces.

